  "description": "Back Garden: \rT1 Lime (x1) Crown lift by 1m. Final height12m and width 10m. Reason:To allow more sunlight over the lawn area.\rT2 Bay (x1) Reduce over hanging branches back to boundary. Reason: Over hanging from neighbours garden.\rOn inspection and review of Council records, the site at 16 Spencer Mews SW8 1HF is not subject to a Tree Preservation Order but is located within the South Lambeth Road Conservation Area.\r\rThe notified works have been considered under section 211 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. The Council does not propose to make a Tree Preservation Order in respect of the trees and raises no objection to the works as described."
